                            "fullDescription": {
                                "markdown": "MongoDB NoSQL injection occurs when untrusted input reaches unsafe `$where` usage,\nwhere query text is interpreted as executable JavaScript.\n\nVulnerable example:\n\n```java\nimport com.mongodb.BasicDBObject;\n\npublic class UserQueryService {\n    public BasicDBObject buildQuery(String whereFromRequest) {\n        // whereFromRequest is untrusted\n        return new BasicDBObject(\"$where\", whereFromRequest); // VULNERABLE\n    }\n}\n```\n\nSafe example:\n\n```java\nimport com.mongodb.BasicDBObject;\n\npublic class UserQueryService {\n    public BasicDBObject buildQuery(String usernameFromRequest) {\n        if (usernameFromRequest == null || !usernameFromRequest.matches(\"[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,64}\")) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"Invalid username\");\n        }\n\n        // Safe: field-based query, no $where JavaScript\n        return new BasicDBObject(\"username\", usernameFromRequest);\n    }\n}\n```\n\nKey operation family covered by this rule is MongoDB `$where` assignment APIs\n(`BasicDBObject.put/append/new ...(\"$where\", ...)`, map-to-query builder flows).",
                                "text": "MongoDB NoSQL injection occurs when untrusted input reaches unsafe `$where` usage,\nwhere query text is interpreted as executable JavaScript.\n\nVulnerable example:\n\n```java\nimport com.mongodb.BasicDBObject;\n\npublic class UserQueryService {\n    public BasicDBObject buildQuery(String whereFromRequest) {\n        // whereFromRequest is untrusted\n        return new BasicDBObject(\"$where\", whereFromRequest); // VULNERABLE\n    }\n}\n```\n\nSafe example:\n\n```java\nimport com.mongodb.BasicDBObject;\n\npublic class UserQueryService {\n    public BasicDBObject buildQuery(String usernameFromRequest) {\n        if (usernameFromRequest == null || !usernameFromRequest.matches(\"[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,64}\")) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"Invalid username\");\n        }\n\n        // Safe: field-based query, no $where JavaScript\n        return new BasicDBObject(\"username\", usernameFromRequest);\n    }\n}\n```\n\nKey operation family covered by this rule is MongoDB `$where` assignment APIs\n(`BasicDBObject.put/append/new ...(\"$where\", ...)`, map-to-query builder flows)."
